<title>THAILAND: Book Club Finance 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Book Club Finance 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year to 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  For 12 months</p>
<p>				   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 3.62	 1.21</p>
<p>    Net			 79.61	21.79</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Book Club Finance and Securities Plc. It is a finance and securities firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
